  "plain": "In the 1960s, the story goes, many American journalists were secretly paid by the CIA, in an effort known as Operation Mockingbird. The filmmaker Jeremy Corbell, who makes documentaries about UFOs, tells Michels he heard that \"a lot of the journalists\" were on the payroll, and that \"we've got their names now and what they were paid.\" If true, the CIA could have shaped what the press reported, UFOs included."
